      "scene_id": "07",
      "screenshot_id": "010-fresh-session-saved-settings",
      "start": 210.059,
      "end": 212.92,
      "text": "This readback checks the setting that was actually saved."
    },
    {
      "cue": 60,
      "scene_id": "07",
      "screenshot_id": "010-fresh-session-saved-settings",
      "start": 213.279,
      "end": 217.15,
      "text": "Repeat that check on the display used by your team, and assess the text from"
    },
    {
      "cue": 61,
      "scene_id": "07",
      "screenshot_id": "010-fresh-session-saved-settings",
      "start": 217.15,
      "end": 218.92,
      "text": "the distance where viewers will read it."
    },
    {
      "cue": 62,
      "scene_id": "08",
      "screenshot_id": "008-reloaded-neutral-readiness-counts",
      "start": 219.069,
      "end": 222.079,
      "text": "These panels can support more than fire and E M S."
    },
    {
      "cue": 63,
      "scene_id": "08",
      "screenshot_id": "008-reloaded-neutral-readiness-counts",
      "start": 222.5,
      "end": 226.449,
      "text": "A security supervisor can compare staffing with patrol-unit states."
    },
    {
      "cue": 64,
      "scene_id": "08",
      "screenshot_id": "008-reloaded-neutral-readiness-counts",
      "start": 226.82,
      "end": 230.619,
      "text": "A search-and-rescue coordinator can review people and vehicles separately."
    },
    {
      "cue": 65,
      "scene_id": "08",
      "screenshot_id": "008-reloaded-neutral-readiness-counts",
      "start": 230.97,
      "end": 235.56,
      "text": "Community paramedicine and mental health response teams, wildland contractors"
    },
    {
      "cue": 66,
      "scene_id": "08",
      "screenshot_id": "008-reloaded-neutral-readiness-counts",
      "start": 235.56,
      "end": 239.849,
      "text": "and industrial emergency response teams can use the same distinction between"
    },
    {
      "cue": 67,
      "scene_id": "08",
      "screenshot_id": "008-reloaded-neutral-readiness-counts",
      "start": 239.849,
      "end": 242.56,
      "text": "personnel status, staffing and unit state."
